```
But `max-height:520` hides player panel; fine.

Wait portrait 390x844, quest width 205 ends 220, minimap starts 278. good. Only <380.

Add. Also maybe `.center-prompt` for touch lower (58%) over player. okay.

Now remove debug and add favicon/media/shadows/ambient.

